Stay still.

3160
01:34:44,600 --> 01:34:45,320
Does it look good?

3161
01:34:45,320 --> 01:34:45,760
It does.

3162
01:34:52,720 --> 01:34:53,240
Cao Yiheng.

3163
01:34:53,240 --> 01:34:54,200
Hello, sir!

3164
01:35:06,200 --> 01:35:08,920
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

3165
01:35:08,920 --> 01:35:11,520
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

3166
01:35:11,520 --> 01:35:15,720
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

3167
01:35:16,880 --> 01:35:19,600
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

3168
01:35:19,600 --> 01:35:22,240
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

3169
01:35:22,240 --> 01:35:26,320
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

3170
01:35:27,040 --> 01:35:28,440
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

3171
01:35:28,440 --> 01:35:29,760
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

3172
01:35:29,760 --> 01:35:31,080
♪Love out loud♪

3173
01:35:31,080 --> 01:35:32,480
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

3174
01:35:32,480 --> 01:35:33,720
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

3175
01:35:33,720 --> 01:35:35,120
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

3176
01:35:35,120 --> 01:35:38,080
♪Just be a little braver♪

3177
01:35:38,080 --> 01:35:39,320
♪Keep moving♪

3178
01:35:39,440 --> 01:35:40,920
♪Keep moving♪

3179
01:35:40,920 --> 01:35:44,280
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

3180
01:35:46,640 --> 01:35:49,000
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

3181
01:35:59,440 --> 01:36:04,880
♪Keep moving♪

3182
01:36:04,880 --> 01:36:07,520
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

3183
01:36:07,520 --> 01:36:12,880
♪Go discover♪

3184
01:36:12,880 --> 01:36:16,280
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

3185
01:36:18,720 --> 01:36:21,520
♪Come closer♪
